# W060 — the foundation-renderers battery's runtime-only link state.
# This directory is NOT a pnpm workspace package (pnpm-workspace.yaml is
# frozen), so the glTF bridge package's link script (the W060 chain root)
# creates node_modules -> ../../../adapters/foundations/gltf/node_modules
# at test time (idempotent; see
# adapters/foundations/gltf/scripts/link-local.mjs).
# The parent harness's `node_modules` pattern (no trailing slash) covers
# this symlink at any depth; this entry is defensive documentation so the
# link state is never committed.
node_modules
